Begin3
Title:          FDSMTPOP
Description:    Mail transfer agent
SUmmary:		FDSMTPOP client is a mail transfer agent useful for Pegasus Mail, FreeEMACS and UUPC environments and can function as an upgrade to SMTPOP, SMTPGATE or PMPOP. Archive contains sources (for TC 2.01), DOS executables and brief documentation.  Modifications by JZ include addition of SMTP authentication functionality and some minor fixes.
Keywords:       smtp, pop3
End
